## Completion bar

Do not claim Windows work is done until: build passes; and for tasks that need runtime verification — app launches via `winapp run` and behavior is confirmed (MCP, logs, or user review as appropriate). Failures need `DebugOutput` logs and/or MCP screenshots when MCP was used.
